Implicit commodity postings are checked without duplicating explicit warnings.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Holdings
account Bank
account Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 100 USD
2024-01-01 Transfer without basis
  Holdings  2 FUND
  Opening

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Positive FUND posting must use a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}) and no transaction price (@ or @@), except when both prices are zero; the default commodity is USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:11:3

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Negative FUND posting must use both a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}) and a transaction price (@ or @@); the default commodity is USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:12:3

[NEGATIVE_POSTING_DATE_HOLDING] Opening: holding is -2 FUND on 2024-01-01 using posting dates; disposals must not precede available acquisitions
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:12:3
